ine/godot/pull/121988.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-04T16:52:30Z"},"body":"The `TextEdit::clear()` method was emitting `lines_edited_from` with an invalid line index (`old_text_size` instead of `old_text_size - 1`). Since lines are 0-indexed, the last line index is `old_text_size - 1`.\r\n\r\nThis caused out-of-bounds access in `CodeEdit::_update_delimiter_cache()`.\r\n\r\nAlso updates the test to expect the correct signal parameters.\r\n\r\nValidated by building the Windows editor with SCons and testing it.\r\n\r\n\r\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\r\n\r\n[new-game.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30614430/new-game.zip)\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121988/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121988/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}